mall brush and he's going to use  natural pigment like they were used back  in the 1400s  there has been the surveillance of the  italian  authority over this fresco we are not  allowed in italy to  paint back anything it is not present  the whole restoration took a long time  it took  18 months we are very proud that we  didn't lose  this piece of art in tuscany  you

